# 6. WORLD FIRST — NOT JUST A STADIUM

The current game feels like a stadium test environment.

Fix this.

The player must eventually feel like they exist in a real football world.

Update 1.0 should establish a **compact but visually rich town** surrounding the main gameplay areas.

The world should include:

```text
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │     TOWN CENTER     │
                    │ shops / NPCs / plaza│
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
              ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
              │                │                │
              ▼                ▼                ▼
        RESIDENTIAL       TRAINING AREA      SHOPS
        DISTRICT                             
              │                │
              │                ▼
              │          TRAINING STADIUM
              │
              ▼
       MAIN FOOTBALL STADIUM
              │
              ▼
       SOCIAL / PARK AREA
```

This does NOT need to be enormous.

It needs to be **dense and interesting**.

