# 43. DATASTORE ERROR

The current Studio Output shows:

`StudioAccessToApisNotAllowed`

and:

`Cannot write to DataStore from studio if API access is not enabled.`

This is a separate development configuration issue.

Do not confuse this with the visual problem.

Handle Studio DataStore failure gracefully.

The game should not spam errors when Studio API access is disabled.

If appropriate, make the DataStore service detect Studio/API availability and clearly log:

```text
[DataService] Studio DataStore access unavailable.
[DataService] Running with temporary session data.
```

Do not silently pretend that data was permanently saved.

Production DataStore behavior must remain secure.

